__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">Ore</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$46.8/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$48.6/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.26.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 17th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> (or Infused Ink) is a material that can be obtained by exposing forged <b><a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a></b> to a spore projectile shot by a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\"><b>Mysterious Mushroom</b></a>. \n</p><p><b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> Is a part of the quest for obtaining the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\"><b>Uncertain Pickaxe</b></a>, which involves placing the <b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> on the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Adurite_Key\" title=\"Adurite Key\">Key</a></b> pedestals.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> emits unique cubic particles with a faint checkered pattern resembling a Missing Texture placeholder.</li>\n<li>Both the refined and forged forms of <b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> share the same material with their <b><a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a></b> counterparts with the only difference being that they are now colored hot pink and have a bright glow emanating from them.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>One of the loading screen tips reads \"<b>Ink</b> is the new pink\", which is alluding to this ore.</li>\n<li><b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b> emits purple square checkerboard particles, which vaguely represent the famous Missing Texture checkerboard.</li>\n<li>When a player inspects a schematic filled with <b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b>, it will instead be called \"<b>InfusedInk</b>\" as opposed to \"<b>?&#160;?&#160;?</b>\".</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding